 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS: 剪定不要。Walters: 晩冬に古葉を刈る。MBG/NC State: 抑えたいときは高刈りできる。MBG「適地ではやや aggressive」、RHS「厄介になりうる」は控えめな書き方で、はびこるとの明記ではないと読み E にしない（mixing も「強い」）",
  "management_type_quote": "No pruning required",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": null,
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[RHS/品種] Aspect: North-facing or East-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 3／NC State・種] can be somewhat aggressive / [RHS・品種] spreads enthusiastically with the potential to become a nuisance（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] spreads by rhizomes and seeds（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] Spreads by both creeping roots and self-seeding to form an attractive ground cover in moist, shady areas.\n[地下茎 2／NC State・種] It can grow 6- 12 inches tall and up to 2 feet in length and spreads by rhizomes and seeds.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 地下茎：言い回しの照合では 2、文を読み直して 3（[NC State・種] can be somewhat aggressive / [RHS・品種] spreads enthusiastically with the potential to become a nuisance）\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：ランナー）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）\n[管理タイプの見直し] 文を読んで隔離推奨型にしなかったので、侵略的 から 強い に下げた\n[ユーザーの決定 2026-11-24] 読み直しで段階 3（地下茎 3 より）。植物の性質として書かれているので 侵略的・隔離推奨型",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[RHS・品種] Habit: Matforming",
